01:13:36.429 --> 01:13:40.160
- Keno. i told you...
- I know. This is not my fight.

1003
01:13:40.076 --> 01:13:42.101
- At last!
- Come on. Let's go.

1004
01:13:42.092 --> 01:13:44.856
- I'm coming.
- I learned that from a rat.

1005
01:13:44.813 --> 01:13:46.280
Later. Keno. dude!

1006
01:13:50.604 --> 01:13:53.698
Tokka and Rahzar.
How cute.

1007
01:13:53.644 --> 01:13:57.512
Hey. We could make
a fortune in the diet racket.

1008
01:13:57.420 --> 01:13:59.149
Oh. Mikey.

1009
01:14:00.139 --> 01:14:03.336
- Maybe he set a distance record.
- Doubtful.

1010
01:14:03.275 --> 01:14:05.209
Hey. where'd he go?

1011
01:14:09.547 --> 01:14:12.573
- Anything?
- Nothing.

1012
01:14:12.523 --> 01:14:16.516
Well. dudes. i'd say
that's pretty much a wrap.

1013
01:14:16.427 --> 01:14:19.089
Cowabunga?

1014
01:14:19.051 --> 01:14:21.178
- Cowabunga!
- Yeah!

1015
01:14:21.162 --> 01:14:23.426
Cowabunga!

1016
01:14:40.713 --> 01:14:46.117
- The last vial of ooze!
- He must have drank all of it.

1017
01:14:45.961 --> 01:14:48.555
it's a super Shredder.

1018
01:14:59.369 --> 01:15:02.361
Great! Now what
are we supposed to do?

1019
01:15:05.993 --> 01:15:09.690
This thing can't take much more of this.
not with all that stuff on top.

1020
01:15:12.328 --> 01:15:15.024
Shredder. you got
to listen to reason!

1021
01:15:14.984 --> 01:15:17.077
You're gonna
destroy us all!

1022
01:15:19.016 --> 01:15:21.246
Then so be it!

1023
01:15:22.056 --> 01:15:23.614
You okay?

1024
01:15:25.352 --> 01:15:27.752
it's all coming down!

1025
01:15:27.720 --> 01:15:29.278
Watch your head. guys!

1026
01:15:30.983 --> 01:15:32.848
We're pancakes!

1027
01:15:36.519 --> 01:15:40.011
A true ninja is a master
of himself and his environment.

1028
01:15:39.943 --> 01:15:43.777
So don't forget.
We're turtles!

1029
01:16:26.404 --> 01:16:29.271
i've said it before.
and i'll say it again.

1030
01:16:29.221 --> 01:16:33.521
"Man. i love
being a turtle!"

1031
01:16:33.413 --> 01:16:36.109
- Too bad the Shredder can't say that.
- Yeah.

1032
01:16:36.708 --> 01:16:39.233
- Look!
- Wha...

1033
01:16:39.204 --> 01:16:41.729
it can't be.

1034
01:16:41.700 --> 01:16:44.692
Nobody could
have survived that.

1035
01:16:49.604 --> 01:16:51.799
That's the end
of the Shredder.

1036
01:16:51.779 --> 01:16:54.680
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

1037
01:16:54.628 --> 01:16:57.119
And in a bizarre
final note...

1038
01:16:57.091 --> 01:16:59.582
to the mysterious
disappearance of TGRI...

1039
01:16:59.555 --> 01:17:03.958
this message was delivered
to the station earlier today.

1040
01:17:03.843 --> 01:17:08.507
'"To Leonardo.
Michaelangelo. Raphael...

1041
01:17:08.386 --> 01:17:10.877
- And Donatello...
- Idiots.

1042
01:17:10.851 --> 01:17:14.582
thanks for
your help. dudes.

1043
01:17:14.498 --> 01:17:16.728
Signed.
ProfessorJordan Perry. "

1044
01:17:17.538 --> 01:17:20.371
Of course we can only
guess at its meaning.

1045
01:17:21.218 --> 01:17:22.708
And now this.

1046
01:17:26.210 --> 01:17:28.144
Bodacious!

1047
01:17:28.130 --> 01:17:31.531
- Ostentatious!
- Hey. hey. spacious!

1048
01:17:31.458 --> 01:17:34.291
Hey. dudes!
Cowabunga says it all!

1049
01:17:34.242 --> 01:17:37.040
Cowabunga!

1050
01:17:36.993 --> 01:17:38.927
Oh. yeah!

1051
01:17:39.873 --> 01:17:42.501
We're home.

1052
01:17:43.457 --> 01:17:45.516
Were you seen?

1053
01:17:45.505 --> 01:17:47.803
- Of course not. Master Splinter.
- We practice ninja.

1054
01:17:47.777 --> 01:17:49.870
The art of invisibility.

1055
01:17:53.985 --> 01:17:55.953
Practice harder.

1056
01:17:58.272 --> 01:18:01.207
Ten flips now!
And remember...

1057
01:18:01.152 --> 01:18:03.211
"Go. ninja
Go. ninja. go!"

1058
01:18:04.832 --> 01:18:06.766
i made another funny!

1059
01:18:07.305 --> 01:19:07.343
